# L §7.6 item 1 (tally 2.1.6, issue #89): a month range by 3 anchored on the 15th ends its last period
# (9999-11-15) on 10000-02-14, past 9999-12-31: LOAD-LIMIT. tally 2.1.5's refcore refused it REFCORE-NOT-YET
# (ValueError).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index ms = month 9999-02..9999-12 by 3 from 15

ask n: max(pos(k) for k in ms)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LIMIT index ms: a day passes 9999-12-31 (m.tally:9)
